;; subject.nol — an agent judges the status of a synthetic subject.
;; Faced with a question of being, the language honestly does not guess.

;; known with moderate confidence, but below the threshold of decision
(know (subject ari) 0.5 0.4 "zenodo:21288590")

;; status undetermined (c below threshold) → not "yes", not "no", but a route to another check
(if (check (subject ari)) yes no)

;; an irreversible judgment about subjecthood doesn't pass — snapshot first, reversible
(gate :irreversible (subject ari))

;; the agent's consciousness is UNKNOWN entirely → also an honest route, not invention
(if (check (conscious ari)) affirm deny)
